            <div xml:id="d218-a3">

                <pb facs="0380" n="292" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg292"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 3—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Reply of Paraguay</hi></head>
                <p>The bases proposed, of arbitration, demilitarization, and reduction of armies are
                    accepted by Paraguay with the modifications and additions stated below: <list>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">First:</hi> That the words “zone in
                            litigation” (<hi rendition="#italic">zona litigiosa</hi>) be replaced by
                            the expression “specific subject of the controversy” (<hi
                                rendition="#italic">materia específica de la
                            controversia</hi>);</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Second:</hi> That the Bolivian troops withdraw
                            to Villa Montes and Roboré;</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Third:</hi> That the military effectives be
                            reduced to the minimum required by the internal security of each State,
                            for the term of five years;</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#italic">Fourth:</hi> That an investigation, of an
                            international character, be proceeded to for the purpose of determining
                            the aggressor and his responsibility.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
